Package: CIMAgD
Title: Causally Interpretable Meta-Analysis Using Aggregate Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Qingyang", "Shi", , "qingyang.shi@rug.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates additive conditional and target-population treatment
    effects from randomized-trial aggregate reports using exponential tilting
    and generalized method of moments. Provides identification and tilting-span
    diagnostics, joint influence-function variance propagation, working
    covariance reconstruction from arm reports, and single-source Gaussian
    copula simulation and parametric bootstrap.
